# ROM first stage: the generic ramdisk section of Infinity X Android 17
# boot.img, held in the private i7m7r8/flame-stock repo and fetched by CI. This
# hash is the only thing about it that can be public. sha256sum -c format, so
# `sha256sum -c config/stock-ramdisk.sha256` works next to the download.
